{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08600","headline":"秋浦清溪雪夜对酒客有唱山鹧鸪者 · 李白","name":"秋浦清溪雪夜对酒客有唱山鹧鸪者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"披君貂襜褕，对君白玉壶。\n雪花酒上灭，顿觉夜寒无。\n客有桂阳至，能吟山鹧鸪。\n清风动窗竹，越鸟起相呼。\n持此足爲乐，何烦笙与竽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}